---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { withBase } from '../utils/paths';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="A little about Kymeas Panhavoan, a back-end developer based in Phnom Penh.">
  <section class="shell page-intro about-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">A little context</p>
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p>I’m Panhavoan, a back-end developer based in Phnom Penh. I like building the parts of a system people don’t see, and understanding why they behave the way they do. <a class="text-link" href={withBase('/resume/')}>See my résumé <Icon name="arrow" /></a></p>
  </section>

  <div class="shell about-grid ruled-section">
    <div class="prose about-copy">
      <h2>How I got here</h2>
      <p>I started with Python and FastAPI, then picked up Java and Spring Boot by building things with them — most recently AngkorLance, a freelance marketplace I worked on with a small team. These days I write back-end services at Innotech Solutions and study at the Royal University of Phnom Penh.</p>
      <h2>What I’m into</h2>
      <p>Data engineering, mostly. I’m working through the DataTalks.Club Zoomcamp — Docker, Postgres, workflow orchestration — and I keep notes on it here. I care about systems that stay predictable under load and fail in ways you can actually debug.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="about-aside">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</p><ul class="elsewhere"><li><a href="https://github.com/Panhavoan-Kymeas"><Icon name="github" /> GitHub <span>↗</span></a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/panhavoan-kymeas-28b241314"><Icon name="linkedin" /> LinkedIn <span>↗</span></a></li><li><a href="mailto:kymeaspanhavoan@gmail.com"><Icon name="mail" /> Email <span>↗</span></a></li></ul></div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
